{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00679","headline":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 煌煌 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 煌煌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"煌煌道宫，肃肃太清。\n礼光尊祖，乐备充庭。\n罄竭诚至，希夷降灵。\n云凝翠盖，风焰红旌。\n衆真以从，九奏初迎。\n永惟休佑，是锡和平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}